<section image-layout="blank" id="YSFiJ61EK-" vertical-align="center"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="dt4rVXayuh"><p role="eyebrow">Illustrative exercise&#x2014;not measured conference data</p><h2>One brief, 24 departures</h2><p>Generate broadly first. Apply the evidence gate second.</p><grid spacing="small"><grid-item id="cdfq_SwvPY" colspan="36"><p role="eyebrow">Generation field &#xb7; 4 rounds &#xd7; 6 each</p><table col-widths="[22,13,13,13,13,13,13]" header-row="true" borders="all" striped="false"><tbody><tr><td><p>Round</p></td><td><p>A</p></td><td><p>B</p></td><td><p>C</p></td><td><p>D</p></td><td><p>E</p></td><td><p>F</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p><span text-color="accent">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="accent">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="accent">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="accent">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="accent">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="accent">&#x25cf;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-2">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-2">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-2">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-2">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-2">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-2">&#x25cf;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-3">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-3">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-3">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-3">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-3">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-3">&#x25cf;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-4">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-4">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-4">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-4">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-4">&#x25cf;</span></p></td><td><p><span text-color="palette-4">&#x25cf;</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p role="caption"><span text-color="muted">Each dot is one departure; one rule changes per round. No observed advance count is claimed.</span></p></grid-item><grid-item id="gR0LHengDi" vertical-align="center" colspan="4"><p font-size="32pt" align="center"><span text-color="accent">&#x2192;</span></p></grid-item><grid-item id="LckDnOLEJ5" background-color="surface" padding="16pt" colspan="20"><labels><label variant="solid">Review gate</label></labels><display size="md" font-size="40pt">3</display><p>independent reviewers</p><p role="eyebrow">Two marks</p><h4>Surprising + usable</h4><hr color="neutral-border"><display size="md" font-size="40pt">2 of 3</display><p>must give both marks for an idea to advance.</p></hr></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>